\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {B.8}{\ignorespaces \textsc  {Liso} simulation of the noise of the circuit used for measuring photocurrents of $\sim \tmspace  -\thinmuskip {.1667em}10\tmspace  +\thinmuskip {.1667em}\si {\milli \ampere }$. This circuit is shown in Figure\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {fig:pdchapterqetestcircuit}. Note that the simulation may not be accurate above 1\tmspace  +\thinmuskip {.1667em}MHz due to the unusually high output impedance of the AD797 and the capacitive load to ground. \relax }}{266}{figure.caption.128}}
